WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:05.100
I fell out of the sky on purpose.

00:05.600 --> 00:09.000
They said I'd die on the parapet

00:09.000 --> 00:12.500
Wet stone, wind, and a name they'd forget

00:12.600 --> 00:16.400
Scribe's daughter, brittle bones

00:16.400 --> 00:20.600
Ines caught my wrist, said "You're not alone"

00:21.400 --> 00:23.800
My brother burned three years ago

00:23.800 --> 00:28.200
His dragon wouldn't choose, said no, no, no

00:28.200 --> 00:31.200
Threshing took her, took the ground

00:31.300 --> 00:35.000
Then the old green landed and she looked me down

00:35.100 --> 00:40.600
Let him go, let him go

00:40.700 --> 00:46.100
The bronze cracked open in my hand

00:47.200 --> 00:54.500
The day I stopped being scared of falling

00:54.700 --> 01:00.200
Was the day I chose what to fall for
